# Decision Records

Each decision record explains one choice and why it was made.

- Name the file `NNNN-short-title.md` with a four-digit number.
- Never reuse a number, even after a record is withdrawn.
- Give every record one status, `accepted`, `proposed` or `superseded`.
- Record one decision per file.
- Supersede a record with a new one instead of editing history.
- Write the sections Context, Decision and Consequences in every record, starting from `0000-template.md`.

